---
manual: element.edit_line
lines: [1978, 1982]
testability: api
display: native
ledger: G16
----------- app code
# An ext pin (ledger G16): Shoes 3.2.15 added edit_line.finish = proc, run when Return is
# pressed in the line (s3t_edit_line.c:15, 42-49), so a one-line form sends from the keyboard.
$sent = []
Shoes.app do
  @line = edit_line
  @line.finish = proc { |line| $sent << line.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_line("@line")
type_text "tea"
assert_empty $sent, "typing does not finish the line"
press_key "\n"
assert_equal ["tea"], $sent, "Return runs the finish proc with the line and its text"
